# ARK Subsystem Lifecycle

**Catalog:** [docs/runtime/README.md](../../docs/runtime/README.md) · **Cleanup:** [ark-cleanup-sprint-discipline.mdc](ark-cleanup-sprint-discipline.mdc)

## Full lifecycle (what replaced Pressure → Code)

```text
Pressure             ← repeated operational pain; observe before building
        ↓
Authority            ← what production truth is
        ↓
Inventory            ← classify with Proof; zero Unknown
        ↓
Runtime              ← one page: how it works (docs/runtime/)
        ↓
Cleanup              ← delete obsolete architecture; Behavior changes: 0
        ↓
Observation          ← shop evidence; baseline log; boring = success
        ↓
Baseline             ← known-good operations snapshot frozen
        ↓
Evolution            ← features only after baseline earns trust
```

**Production earns the right to evolve.** Not because a sprint ended — because the baseline demonstrated reliability.

**"Nuke it" is healthy** only when paired with: define authority · inventory with evidence · delete mechanically · observe before evolving.

---

## Three states (every subsystem)

More useful than alpha/beta/production for ARK engineering.

### State 1 — Converging

Questions still being answered. Architecture not yet trusted.

| Allowed | Not allowed |
| --- | --- |
| Inventory | Optimization |
| Cleanup / deletion | Polish |
| Architecture changes | New features |

Voice **today (post Phase B):** mobile runtime converged; backend PV still converging (Phase D pending).

### State 2 — Observing

Architecture frozen for this subsystem. Proving the simplified model on the floor.

| Allowed | Not allowed |
| --- | --- |
| Bug fixes (production broken) | Refactors |
| Evidence · logs · notebooks | Cleanup sprints |
| Baseline observation log | Feature creep |

Voice **today:** **Observing** — certify baseline; no voice code unless production breaks.

### State 3 — Evolving

Baseline has earned trust. Subsystem may grow again.

| Allowed |
| --- |
| Features |
| Improvements |
| Optimization |

**Only after baseline exists** and Stabilize passed.

